# Backend rules

- Preserve existing REST contracts under `/api`.
- Auth: Firebase ID token Bearer + `user_sessions` via `TokenValidate`.
- Org-scoped routes need `OrganisationValidate` and org headers (`ms-organisation-*`).
- Keep controllers thin; put domain logic in `service/`.
- Response envelope: `info` is injected in `index.js` — return `{ data, message }` as today.
- Do not re-enable GraphQL unless explicitly requested (currently commented out).
- Document env changes in `backend/docs/ENVIRONMENT.md`.
- Never commit new secrets; treat existing service account JSON carefully.
